## Curated non-free firmware (`non-free-firmware` archive area)

The firmware packages ship vendor redistribution-permitted binary blobs; the
packaging itself is GPL-2+. These are non-free by DFSG terms and are included
only as far as appliance hardware requires them.

| Package | Version (trixie) | License (as found) |
|---|---|---|
| firmware-realtek | 20250410-2 | GPL-2+ packaging; blobs under vendor binary-redistribution EULAs (Realtek, Hauppauge, Airoha, Intel Pro Wireless) |
| firmware-iwlwifi | 20250410-2 | GPL-2+ packaging; blobs under vendor binary-redistribution EULAs |
| firmware-misc-nonfree | 20250410-2 | GPL-2+ packaging; blobs under vendor binary-redistribution EULAs (includes the Intel ethernet firmware set) |

All three binary packages are built from the single source package
`firmware-nonfree`.

## Complete license texts

Every package's complete copyright and license text ships on the appliance
under `/usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright` and is browsable at
https://sources.debian.org/ — the authoritative, version-pinned source for
every identifier above.
